    "observed_before_preregistration": [
      "The predecessor diagnostic identified exactly seven failed team-game partitions and seventeen DNP-only rows across those partitions.",
      "Independent first-party examples already showed Daryl Worley placed on Reserve/Injured and Damontre Moore waived before OAK's 2018 Week 16 game, Khalen Saunders officially inactive in KC 2021 Week 10, Antonio Brown officially inactive in TB 2021 Week 10, and Chris Wormley officially inactive in PIT 2021 Week 16.",
      "The corrected weekly-roster diagnostic showed generic ACT/INA/A01 values cannot be used as game-day membership authority.",
      "Constructed CMS game-day pages exist for five of the seven frozen contradiction partitions, but their roster/depth anchors are generally current/generic endpoints and therefore do not prove historical pregame chronology.",
      "For JAX 2020 Week 11, the public first-party transaction chronology around Doug Middleton is nontrivial and must be adjudicated from explicit dated events rather than assumed from a weekly status row.",
      "The NO 2020 Week 13 partition has a total-roster-max contradiction but no active-max contradiction, so this DNP-focused experiment is not required to explain that partition solely through its one DNP row."
    ],
